{
  "name": "Mattermost: Slash-Befehle",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "25084de3-e95b-5e22-b0e2-4652511948b1",
      "name": "Hinweise",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Vor dem Aktivieren\n\n1. **Credential** `Webhook mattermost-befehl` (Basic Auth) anlegen, Benutzer `mattermost`, Passwort zufaellig. Mattermost sendet die Zugangsdaten ueber die URL der Slash-Befehle mit.\n2. In Mattermost (Systemkonsole oder Team, Integrationen, Slash-Befehle) zwei Befehle anlegen, Methode POST, Anfrage-URL `http://mattermost:<Passwort>@n8n.n8n.svc.cluster.local/webhook/mattermost-befehl`:\n   - Trigger `ticket`, Beschreibung `Zammad-Ticket anlegen`, Hinweis `[Titel]`\n   - Trigger `status`, Beschreibung `Aktive Alerts anzeigen`\n3. `/ticket` darf nur ein Mattermost-Systemadmin ausfuehren, `/status` jeder.\n4. Workflow aktivieren.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 700
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6c5a6bd4-d01d-5ae1-bbea-49fb1e61d4df",
      "name": "Slash-Befehl empfangen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "ffda23c5-ce8f-50d9-91ae-cf42cf120447",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "mattermost-befehl",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "basicAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_NACH_IMPORT",
          "name": "Webhook mattermost-befehl"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "01588e15-923d-5997-8609-7652c85f6d3c",
      "name": "Befehl auswerten",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst befehl = String(body.command || '').replace(/^\\//, '').toLowerCase();\nreturn [{ json: { befehl, text: String(body.text || '').trim(), user_id: String(body.user_id || ''), user_name: String(body.user_name || 'unbekannt') } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4b9bc913-2151-526c-9711-2ff7ef0f337d",
      "name": "Ist /ticket?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f1d9be70-dfb2-52b7-8065-63342ade0d57",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.befehl === 'ticket' }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ecd58ffd-c7cd-55da-a1c6-50825b4e5b4a",
      "name": "Nutzer laden",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        840,
